silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_15_cocone_apex_and_naturality_sections_01_cocone_apex_construction_step_by_step_concrete_anchor_19_TaxonomyWitness#taxonomywitness silm:hasLongDescription "The TaxonomyWitness is the source-leg evidence row supplying the DomesticCat refinement, distinct from Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TaxonomyWitness', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
